{"id":"fd342e25e150c9c9","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-derivable.md","title":"可推导","display":"df-derivable — 可推导","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-derivable","aliases":["29-df-derivable"],"display":"df-derivable — 可推导","depends_on":["[[29-df-sequent]]"],"source_locator":"Local parameterized sequent-calculus interface"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-derivable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-derivable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-derivable — 可推导"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"165874db46d8b664\" href=\"?note=165874db46d8b664\" title=\"29-df-sequent\">29-df-sequent</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Local parameterized sequent-calculus interface"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-derivable-—-可推导-$\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}}$\">df-derivable — 可推导 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}}\">\\(\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为有限词汇；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Seq}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Seq}_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"165874db46d8b664\" href=\"?note=165874db46d8b664\" title=\"29-df-sequent\">29-df-sequent</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S\">\\(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SC}=(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{SC}},\\mathrm{Rule}_{\\mathrm{SC}})\">\\(\\mathrm{SC}=(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{SC}},\\mathrm{Rule}_{\\mathrm{SC}})\\)</span> 为给定矢列演算参数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{SC}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Seq}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{SC}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Seq}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rule}_{\\mathrm{SC}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Seq}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Seq}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Rule}_{\\mathrm{SC}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Seq}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Seq}_S\\)</span>。未在本条假定这些规则为某个可靠/完备的具体系统。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 为非空有限证明序列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rng}(\\rho)\">\\(\\operatorname{rng}(\\rho)\\)</span> 为分量集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathrm{SC}}(\\pi,\\xi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ |\\pi|&gt;0\\land\\pi_{|\\pi|-1}=\\xi\\land\\forall i&lt;|\\pi|\\;\\left(\\pi_i\\in\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{SC}}\\lor\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\bigl((\\rho,\\pi_i)\\in\\mathrm{Rule}_{\\mathrm{SC}}\\land\\forall\\eta\\in\\operatorname{rng}(\\rho)\\;\\exists j&lt;i\\;\\pi_j=\\eta\\bigr)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathrm{SC}}(\\pi,\\xi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ |\\pi|&gt;0\\land\\pi_{|\\pi|-1}=\\xi\\land\\forall i&lt;|\\pi|\\;\\left(\\pi_i\\in\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{SC}}\\lor\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\bigl((\\rho,\\pi_i)\\in\\mathrm{Rule}_{\\mathrm{SC}}\\land\\forall\\eta\\in\\operatorname{rng}(\\rho)\\;\\exists j&lt;i\\;\\pi_j=\\eta\\bigr)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}}(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathrm{SC}}(\\pi,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}}(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathrm{SC}}(\\pi,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地参数化矢列推导接口。ProofSC的参数类型与有限证明条件已闭合；是否为标准一阶演算由给定规则决定，不能由SC名称推出。此条与普通句子证明接口不同，不再依靠未定义的矢列证明谓词。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-derivable-—-可推导-$\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}}$","text":"df-derivable — 可推导 $\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-sequent","status":"resolved","id":"165874db46d8b664","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-sequent]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-sequent","status":"resolved","id":"165874db46d8b664","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ 为有限词汇；$\\mathrm{Seq}_S$ 见 [[29-df-sequent]]，$\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Seq}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SC}=(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{SC}},\\mathrm{Rule}_{\\mathrm{SC}})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{SC}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Seq}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rule}_{\\mathrm{SC}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Seq}_S^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Seq}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rng}(\\rho)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathrm{SC}}(\\pi,\\xi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ |\\pi|>0\\land\\pi_{|\\pi|-1}=\\xi\\land\\forall i<|\\pi|\\;\\left(\\pi_i\\in\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{SC}}\\lor\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S^{<\\omega}\\;\\bigl((\\rho,\\pi_i)\\in\\mathrm{Rule}_{\\mathrm{SC}}\\land\\forall\\eta\\in\\operatorname{rng}(\\rho)\\;\\exists j<i\\;\\pi_j=\\eta\\bigr)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SC}}(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S^{<\\omega}\\;\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathrm{SC}}(\\pi,\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta).","display":true}],"bytes":1682,"backlinks":[{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-48","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-derivable]]"}],"outgoing":["165874db46d8b664"]}